      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. defines shapes for different simulation events\n\n2. allows us to declare textual representations\nfor simulation events and when they will happen\n\n3. the actual event action gets wrapped in a\nthunk; delayed until it is scheduled",
